# arm64-generic's virtual/chromeos-bsp (2-r1) must never stand in for this
# board's: when a package that ours pulls in cannot be installed (one was
# masked by its EAPI), Portage quietly took arm64-generic's and built an image
# without this board's BSP (boot script, Wi-Fi firmware). With it masked,
# the build stops instead.
<virtual/chromeos-bsp-3
